"{\\n  \\\"message\\\": \\\"You can deposit the check directly into Silver Plus through the Rho-Bank mobile app—no transfer from checking is needed. I’ve made the check-deposit tool available with your savings account and $1,500 amount prefilled; you’ll complete the deposit yourself.\\\\n\\\\n1. Make sure the check is payable to you, isn’t altered or damaged, and the written and numeric amounts agree.\\\\n2. Sign the back and follow the app’s required endorsement wording.\\\\n3. Sign in to the app, select Silver Plus, and choose Mobile Check Deposit.\\\\n4. Use the provided deposit action, take clear photos of the front and back with all four corners visible, then review the destination and amount before submitting.\\\\n\\\\nFunds are typically available within 1–2 business days, but some deposits require longer review. The app will show the expected availability date. Keep the paper check secure until the deposit is posted and available, then destroy it securely.\\\\n\\\\nOnce credited, $1,500 meets your $1,000 opening-deposit minimum. It’s still below the $2,500 ongoing balance requirement, so the possible $8 monthly maintenance fee remains relevant.\\\",\\n  \\\"deposit_action\\\": {\\n    \\\"tool\\\": \\\"deposit_check_3847\\\",\\n    \\\"arguments\\\": {\\n      \\\"account_id\\\": \\\"7e48bf3b0589cfad\\\",\\n      \\\"check_amount\\\": 1500\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\",\"type\":\"output_text\"}],\"id\":\"msg_08d780c1cdf4eab9016abc48a8cbb087d195405a0c0e495c1b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"status\":\"completed\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"content\":\"Okay, let me try that... I’ve got the check ready.\\n\\nDid that work? Can you confirm the money is in there?\",\"role\":\"user\"},{\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqvEi5rrJDNq4r135-T9o8laXHT0Vt8oU9CD-dvMr38QDdsqo96w6f_TDU040LJN6Y1koAP2BGFYTVsPcfGi-Y5NdoeEzydFzXyaRHmvFtHaWQ7jNzOE_7Ad9-QnUr-mF8btmxIeRYqU0ur5fvkCG5YkT-aVYltvwED7MgEyaR09tr7CkmfTpc6rvtR7e585ARgJZ3H8w7-tJXhskNM_Yp7T_6jlkn7GtcNY